   },
   "text": "DEBATE - The House proceeded with 90 minutes of debate on the motion to agree to the Senate amendments to H.R. 1424.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H40130",
   "actionDate": "2008-10-03",
   "actionTime": "10:41:11",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "Pursuant to the provisions of H. Res. 1525, the House moved to agree to the Senate amendments. (consideration: CR H10712-10806)",
   "type": "ResolvingDifferences"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H1L210",
   "actionDate": "2008-10-02",
   "actionTime": "20:32:25",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "Rules Committee Resolution H. Res. 1525 Reported to House. Previous question shall be considered as ordered without intervening motions. Providing for consideration of the Senate amendments to H.R. 1424: the Emergency Economic Stabilization Act of 2008; the Energy Improvement and Extension Act of 2008; and the Tax Extenders and Alternative Minimum Tax Relief Act of 2008. The resolution makes in order a motion by the Chairman of the Committee on Financial Services to concur in the Senate amendments. The resolution waives all points of order against consideration of the motion.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionDate": "2008-10-02",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "name": "Senate"
   },
   "text": "Message on Senate action sent to the House.",
