   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "On motion to recommit with instructions Failed by recorded vote: 196 - 221 (Roll no. 100).",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H8A000",
   "actionDate": "2008-03-05",
   "actionTime": "19:37:56",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "The previous question on the motion to recommit with instructions was ordered without objection. (consideration: CR H1314)",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H8D000",
   "actionDate": "2008-03-05",
   "actionTime": "19:24:38",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "Floor summary: DEBATE - The House proceeded with 10 minutes of debate on the Kline motion to recommit with instructions. The instructions contained in the motion seek to require the bill to be reported back to the House with an amendment in the nature of a substitute consisting of new text entitled \"Mental Health Parity Act of 2008\".",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H36100",
   "actionDate": "2008-03-05",
   "actionTime": "19:24:16",
   "committees": [
    {
     "name": "Energy and Commerce Committee",
     "systemCode": "hsif00",
     "url": "https://api.congress.gov/v3/committee/house/hsif00?format=json"
    }
   ],
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "Mr. Kline (MN) moved to recommit with instructions to Energy and Commerce. (consideration: CR H1309-1314; text: CR H1309-1312)",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H36810",
   "actionDate": "2008-03-05",
   "actionTime": "19:22:11",
   "recordedVotes": [
    {
     "chamber": "House",
     "congress": 110,
     "date": "2008-03-06T00:22:11Z",
     "rollNumber": 99,
     "sessionNumber": 2,
     "url": "https://clerk.house.gov/evs/2008/roll099.xml"
    }
   ],
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "On motion to table the motion to appeal the ruling of the chair Agreed to by the Yeas and Nays: 223 - 186, 1 Present (Roll no. 99).",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H82000",
   "actionDate": "2008-03-05",
   "actionTime": "18:58:19",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "Mr. Pallone moved to table the motion to appeal the ruling of the chair (consideration: CR H1308-1309)",
   "type": "ResolvingDifferences"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H36800",
   "actionDate": "2008-03-05",
   "actionTime": "18:58:03",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "Mr. Hoekstra appealed the ruling of the chair. The question was then put on sustaining the ruling of the chair.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H81000",
   "actionDate": "2008-03-05",
   "actionTime": "18:55:48",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "Mr. Pallone raised a point of order against the motion to recommit with instructions. Mr. Pallone stated that the motion to recommit with instructions sought to insert non-germane material into the bill. Sustained by the Chair.",
   "type": "ResolvingDifferences"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H36110",
   "actionDate": "2008-03-05",
   "actionTime": "18:55:48",
   "committees": [
    {
     "name": "Energy and Commerce Committee",
     "systemCode": "hsif00",
     "url": "https://api.congress.gov/v3/committee/house/hsif00?format=json"
    }
   ],
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "Point of order sustained against the motion to recommit with instructions.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H8D000",
   "actionDate": "2008-03-05",
   "actionTime": "18:51:19",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "DEBATE - The House proceeded with 10 minutes of debate on the Hoekstra motion to recommit with instructions, pending reservation of a point of order. The instructions contained in the motion seek to require the bill to be reported back to the House with a complete new text consisting of the bill H.R. 3773, as passed by the House.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H36100",
   "actionDate": "2008-03-05",
   "actionTime": "18:49:32",
   "committees": [
    {
     "name": "Energy and Commerce Committee",
     "systemCode": "hsif00",
     "url": "https://api.congress.gov/v3/committee/house/hsif00?format=json"
    }
   ],
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "Mr. Hoekstra moved to recommit with instructions to Energy and Commerce. (consideration: CR H1307-1308; text: CR H1307)",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H35000",
   "actionDate": "2008-03-05",
   "actionTime": "18:49:16",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "The previous question was ordered pursuant to the rule. (consideration: CR H1307)",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
   "actionCode": "H8D000",
   "actionDate": "2008-03-05",
   "actionTime": "16:30:44",
   "sourceSystem": {
    "code": 2,
    "name": "House floor actions"
   },
   "text": "DEBATE - The House proceeded with two hours of debate on H.R. 1424.",
   "type": "Floor"
  },
  {
